#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:25
msgid ""
"Your financial overview with customizable tiles. Unlock the dashboard to "
"rearrange, add, or remove tiles. Click the gear icon on the Accounts tile to "
"reorder or hide accounts."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:26
msgid ""
"Manage bank accounts, credit cards, cash, and crypto across 45+ currencies. "
"Click an account to see its transaction history and balance details."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:27
msgid ""
"Add, edit, filter, and bulk-manage transactions. Use the Filters button for "
"advanced search. Split transactions across categories."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:28
msgid ""
"Organise transactions with a hierarchical category tree. Drag to reorder. "
"Click a category to see spending analytics."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:29
msgid ""
"Create tag sets per category for multi-dimensional tracking (e.g. store, "
"project, payment method)."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:30
msgid ""
"Set spending limits per category. Switch between weekly, monthly, quarterly, "
"and yearly periods. Use \"Adjust budgets from this month\" to set different "
"values for future months."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:31
msgid ""
"Track recurring income sources. Use \"Detect Income\" to auto-find patterns. "
"Mark income as received to create transactions."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:32
msgid ""
"Track recurring payments with auto-pay, custom frequencies, and "
"notifications. View the bills calendar in Reports."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:33
msgid ""
"Set up recurring or one-time transfers between your accounts with auto-pay "
"support."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:34
msgid ""
"Set financial targets and track progress. Link goals to tags for automatic "
"amount calculation."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:35
msgid ""
"One budget for a job that runs over months, such as a renovation. It covers "
"a category and its subcategories between two dates, can give its "
"subcategories amounts of their own, and does not reset each month."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:36
msgid ""
"Plan debt repayment using avalanche (highest interest first) or snowball "
"(smallest balance first) strategies."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:37
msgid "Track retirement accounts with contributions and growth projections."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:38
msgid ""
"Track non-liquid assets like property, vehicles, and collectibles with value "
"snapshots over time."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:39
msgid ""
"Split expenses with contacts and track who owes whom. Record settlements to "
"clear debts."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:40
msgid ""
"Predict future account balances using historical spending patterns and "
"scenario modeling."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:41
msgid ""
"Six report types: budget analysis, spending by category, income vs expenses, "
"year-over-year, bills calendar, and net worth history."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:42
msgid ""
"Import bank statements from CSV, OFX, or QIF files. Auto-detects delimiters "
"and supports European number formats."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:43
msgid ""
"Auto-categorise transactions with pattern-based rules. Build complex "
"criteria with AND/OR/NOT logic and preview matches."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:44
msgid ""
"View and manage currency exchange rates. ECB rates for fiat, CoinGecko for "
"crypto. Add manual overrides."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:45
msgid ""
"Share your budget data with other Nextcloud users for household or team "
"financial management."
msgstr ""

#: /app/src/modules/help/HelpModule.js:46
